Vengence is&nbsp;<em>not</em> a stand-alone game. It is an expansion, albeit a large one with 5 hero decks, 2 environments, and one villain encounter (that has multiple setup options if you are playing with under 5 heros). Could someone just pick up Vengence and hit the ground running? Yes. But having at least the core set is strongly recomended by &gt;G and us here at the forums.&nbsp;

Just from your prefered list of decks, I will say that the V5 (villain encounter), Sentinels, Naturalist and KNYFE should be right up your ally. If you are not into controler characters like Visionary or high risk/reward characters like nightmist/ABZero, Parse and Setback (though comparing Parse to Visionary is not exactly fair) might not be your thing, though they are both really fantastic decks! You should really enjoy both environments since you are a Baron fan however.&nbsp;

Hope that helps.

